      <text x='1043' y='90' font-size='12' fill='#4A5568' text-anchor='middle'>闸门 ② postcheck</text>
      <line x1='1043' y1='110' x2='1043' y2='158' stroke='#1E4FA8' strokeWidth='1.8' markerEnd='url(#ah)' />
      <rect x='948' y='162' width='190' height='54' rx='10' fill='#0E3F8C' />
      <text x='1043' y='195' font-size='15' font-weight='bold' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle'>选择集 S → MUAS</text>
      <rect x='18' y='162' width='900' height='54' rx='10' fill='#F7F9FC' stroke='#D6DCE5' strokeWidth='1' />
      <text x='34' y='186' font-size='14' font-weight='bold' fill='#0E3F8C'>cap(t) = max(min_cap, ⌊B(t) / c_med⌋)　　n_sel = min(⌈max_ratio·K⌉, cap(t))</text>
      <text x='34' y='206' font-size='12.5' fill='#4A5568'>B(t) = 可起飞子集剩余航程之和 × 预算系数；充电中的机是幻影容量，不计入 B(t)。</text>
      <rect x='18' y='238' width='1120' height='82' rx='10' fill='#E8EFF8' />
      <text x='34' y='264' font-size='14' font-weight='bold' fill='#0E3F8C'>两道闸门只做可行性，不做价值淘汰；落选任务留池、下周期再评（防饥饿：等待超阈值或逼近 latest 强制纳入候选集）。</text>
      <text x='34' y='288' font-size='13' fill='#4A5568'>闸门 ①：无机可用 / 往返超航程；闸门 ②：机群剩余航程预算。时间窗迟到不是参选资格问题——迟到交付仍计完成。</text>
      <text x='34' y='308' font-size='12' fill='#8B97A8'>代码入口：methods/selection/pipeline.py · capability.py · priority.py；池水位守恒 arrived = done + unreach + elim + remain。</text>
    </svg>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 516, left: 60, width: 1160, height: 138, background: '#F7F9FC', padding: 16, gap: 8 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>为什么第一阶段「不构造成组合问题」</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568' }}>候选池规模由 α·K 与计算上限决定，与机队能力解耦；真正把规模卡紧的是 cap(t)。两阶段之间只传「选择集 S + 机队快照 + DEM 代价接口」。</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568' }}>这样 MUAS 只需在 K 量级上做「归属 × 顺序」的联合搜索，组合规模被压到可解，且落选任务不丢失。</Text>
  </Box>
